---
// The workbook colour legend carried into the UI (BRIEF §B, TOOL_SPECS):
// blue = member-typed input · green = linked from Master · black = computed.
// Meaning is also stated in text, never colour alone (WCAG).
---
<div class="legend" role="group" aria-label="Field colour legend">
  <span class="legend-chip"><span class="swatch swatch-input" aria-hidden="true"></span>Input — you type it</span>
  <span class="legend-chip"><span class="swatch swatch-linked" aria-hidden="true"></span>Linked — read from Master</span>
  <span class="legend-chip"><span class="swatch swatch-computed" aria-hidden="true"></span>Computed — formula output</span>
</div>
